   "source": [
    "Circular motion is $$F = mv^2/r.$$\n",
    "The universal gravitational equation is $$F = \\frac{GMm}{R^2}.$$\n",
    "Assume that the orbit is circular, the centripetal force is provided by gravity, that is $$\\frac{GMm}{R^2} = \\frac{mv^2}{R}.$$\n",
    "Hence, $$v = \\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{R}}.$$"
   ]
